  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Tai Qiu, when Dong Fang Chang Fan’s blood veil thins while pouring purified blood energy into the possession target, demonic path attacks surge and Old Lord Can Yang activates this immortal killer move. A faint afterglow light barrier forms outside the blood veil; attacks still pass through, but their power falls to less than half. The barrier is not full defense: it weakens most attacks, cuts immortal killer moves on the level of Flood Glacier by thirty percent, and leaves the mainly mortal strikes of that moment looking fierce but low in threat.",
      "chapters": [
        792
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "char_old_lord_can_yang",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "move_flood_glacier"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While twin lightnings of heaven and earth batter the site, Old Lord Can Yang keeps final afterglow up at full effort and only weakens that lightning by fifteen percent, with red date immortal essence spent extremely quickly. A nested divine lightning later blows the barrier apart, breaks the blood veil, and drives straight at Dong Fang Yu Liang before the phantom formation answers.",
      "chapters": [
        792
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Final afterglow paired with life chasing fire at Jade Pool blessed land.",
      "chapters": [],
